sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>(e.g., Prometheus)
    participant Proxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Upstream as Upstream Service<br/>8081/TCP HTTP localhost

    Note over Client,Upstream: Flow 1: Authenticated and Authorized Request

    Client->>Proxy: HTTPS/8443 Request<br/>Auth: Bearer Token / Client Cert / OIDC
    activate Proxy

    Note over Proxy: TLS Termination<br/>(CertReloader hot-reload)

    Note over Proxy: Path Allow/Ignore Filter

    alt Delegating TokenReview
        Proxy->>K8sAPI: POST /apis/authentication.k8s.io/v1/tokenreviews<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
        K8sAPI-->>Proxy: TokenReview Response (user identity)
    else OIDC JWT Validation
        Note over Proxy: Validate JWT locally<br/>via go-oidc
    else Client TLS Certificate
        Note over Proxy: Validate X.509 cert<br/>against trusted CAs
    end

    Note over Proxy: Authorization Chain<br/>(union: hardcoded → static → SAR)

    alt Hardcoded Authorizer Match
        Note over Proxy: Allow prometheus-k8s SA<br/>GET /metrics (bypass SAR)
    else SubjectAccessReview
        Proxy->>K8sAPI: POST /apis/authorization.k8s.io/v1/subjectaccessreviews<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
        K8sAPI-->>Proxy: SAR Response (allowed/denied)
    end

    Note over Proxy: Audit Log (JSON structured)

    alt Authorized
        Proxy->>Upstream: HTTP Request (localhost)<br/>Optional: injected auth headers
        Upstream-->>Proxy: HTTP Response
        Proxy-->>Client: HTTPS Response<br/>TLS 1.2+
    else Denied
        Proxy-->>Client: 403 Forbidden<br/>TLS 1.2+
    end

    deactivate Proxy
